  All user-visible strings.

  Two layers:
   - The "text" sections are pure display text; changing wording or adding a
     language only touches this file
   - Entries with %1$s are format strings. Kotlin always calls
     getString(R.string.x, arg) (never string concatenation, which would make
     word-order changes impossible)
-->
